{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ScanMe 是一款無廣告、無需註冊帳戶的 QR 碼與條碼掃描工具，適合經常需要讀取商品條碼、開啟 Wi-Fi 網絡或把紙本文件數碼化的使用者。它可完全離線運作，掃描與生成的內容只保存在裝置上，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-177.webp\">\n<h2>掃描條碼同時生成專屬 QR 碼</h2>\n<p>ScanMe 可掃描 QR 碼及 EAN-13、Code 128、PDF417 等 12 種以上條碼格式，並把結果辨識成連結、Wi-Fi、聯絡人、電郵、電話或產品等可讀資訊，方便直接開啟、致電或儲存。內建文件掃描器具備邊緣偵測，可拍攝多頁文件並存成 PDF，亦可自行生成網址、文字或 Wi-Fi 的 QR 碼。記錄只保存在裝置內，並支援文字辨識與 18 種語言。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-204-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-205-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-206-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-207-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-208-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-209-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ScanMe: QR &amp; Barcode Scanner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T16:16:20.031937+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:03:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T20:17:31.567227+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:14:26.357850+00:00","content_hash":"5af4e3fbba15f82f7ef8b1bf71e1934443b0814cacbdf14c5f0c97daca518af6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}